{"title": "Transmuter's Stone (Lightning)", "pageid": 49733, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Transmuter's_Stone_(Lightning)", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the item. For the ability which creates it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance\">Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance</a>.   For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone (disambiguation)\">Transmuter's Stone (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp/300px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp, /w/images/7/7e/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Transmuter's Stone (Lightning) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp/300px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Item_Lightning.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>A <b>Transmuter's Stone</b> is a stone imbued with magic by a wizard of the <a href=\"/wiki/Transmutation_School\" title=\"Transmutation School\">Transmutation School</a> which provides the holder resistance to lightning damage. Transmutation wizards can create such stones with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp/25px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp/38px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp/50px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transmuter's Stone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp/25px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Constitution_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone\">Transmuter's Stone</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Though the stone's surface surges with flickers of electricity, the lightning never seems to touch your fingers.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-e4460d176f2291bdEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4bfc1f6d3ba1fa55END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOOT_Spell_TransmutersStone_Resistance_Lightning</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Spell_TransmutersStone_Resistance_Lightning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOOT_Spell_TransmutersStone_Resistance_Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8233e8e7-55c9-4f72-8e7b-5f3dc36e250f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8233e8e7-55c9-4f72-8e7b-5f3dc36e250f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8233e8e7-55c9-4f72-8e7b-5f3dc36e250f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p>The holder receives <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span id=\"Condition:_Transmuter.27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Transmuter's_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance\"> Condition: Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/58/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/58/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/58/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance_(Condition)\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance (Condition)\">Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> Damage, as long as it carries the transmuter's stone.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Conjured with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp/25px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp/38px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp/50px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp/25px-Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Transmuter%27s_Stone_Resistance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Transmuter%27s_Stone:_Lightning_Resistance\" title=\"Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance\">Transmuter's Stone: Lightning Resistance</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>A <a href=\"/wiki/Transmutation_School\" title=\"Transmutation School\">Transmutation School</a> wizard can only have one transmuter's stone created at a time. Creating a new one destroys the old one.</li>\n<li>The stone will persist indefinitely until the wizard creates a new one, is dismissed from the party, or changes class.</li>\n<li>The stone can freely be passed to a party member other than the wizard who created it. Whoever carries it will get the bonus.</li>\n<li>A single character can benefit from multiple transmuter's stones of different types, though they require multiple Transmutation wizards in the party to create.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213050\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2285/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37912/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11154/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930906/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   75.284      1 -total\n 98.78%   74.363      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n 58.14%   43.772      9 Template:Icon_text\n 52.01%   39.158     24 Template:Trim\n 30.41%   22.893      1 Template:PageSeo\n 30.28%   22.794      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 28.76%   21.654      5 Template:Icon_link\n 21.76%   16.382      2 Template:SAI\n 19.30%   14.527      9 Template:Ifempty\n 19.17%   14.432      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:49733-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213050 and revision id 386838. Rendering was triggered because: p